                                   'Important forms include:\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   '1. Method overloading\n'
                                   '2. Method overriding\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'Method overloading happens when methods have the same name\n'
                                   'but different parameter lists.\n'
                                   '\n'
                                   'Method overriding occurs when a subclass provides its own\n'
                                   'implementation of an inherited method.\n',
